For what it's worth, this naive (and arguably inefficient) implementation would seem to resolve the issue:

```patch
 bool ClassDB::_is_parent_class(const StringName &p_class, const StringName &p_inherits) {
 	ClassInfo *c = classes.getptr(p_class);
-	while (c) {
-		if (c->name == p_inherits) {
-			return true;
-		}
-		c = c->inherits_ptr;
-	}
+	if (!c) {
+		List<StringName> script_classes;
+		ScriptServer::get_inheriters_list(p_inherits, &script_classes);
+		return script_classes.find(p_class) != nullptr;
+	} else {
+		while (c) {
+			if (c->name == p_inherits) {
+				return true;
+			}
+			c = c->inherits_ptr;
+		}
+	}

 	return false;
```

But I'm unsure if there needs to be some special accommodation for GDExtension as well, like there is with the other `ClassDB` methods that defer to `ScriptServer`.

I'm also not very familiar with this `ClassDB` and `ClassInfo` stuff in general, so I'm not super confident in the change to begin with.
